ZVSE2

** MINERJACK - combination artifact (misc slot)
**
** Parts: Inexhaustible Cart of Ore (112) + Inexhaustible Cart of Lumber (114).
** When combined, the parts no longer count as owned, so their daily resources (+2 Ore / +2 Wood
** with Advanced Classes Mod) are replaced by this artifact:
**   - +10 Wood and +10 Ore per day for the owner of the hero, equipped or in the backpack.
** Price: the sum of its parts (5000 + 5000).
**
** Artifact 281, combination slot 24. Icon: artifact.def frame 281 and Emerald's artraits.txt row 281
** (Data/EmeraldArtifacts.pac and Data/00 forge and fury.pac), png in Data/forge and fury.zip.
** Enabled/disabled in WoG Options -> Custom Scripts, option 955 "Custom Artifacts" (shared by all new artifacts).

; ============= SETTINGS ===========================================================================

!#DC(MJ_OPTION)             = 955;       [shared option "Custom Artifacts"]
!#DC(MJ_ART)                = 281;
!#DC(MJ_COMBO_SLOT)         = 24;       [ResOunD: 13-22, Pegasus Harness: 23]
!#DC(MJ_COST)               = 10000;
!#DC(MJ_ART_CLASS)          = 16;       [Relic]
!#DC(MJ_ART_POSITION)       = 9;        [Misc slot (ERM Format P2)]

!#DC(MJ_WOOD_PER_DAY)       = 10;
!#DC(MJ_ORE_PER_DAY)        = 10;

!#UN:P(MJ_OPTION)/?i^mj_enabled^;
!#VRi^mj_enabled^|i^cr_hasResound^<>(TRUE):S(FALSE); [needs Resound, see "31 forge and fury - dependencies.erm"]

; Named globals are stored in savegames, so re-read the option after a game is started or loaded
!?FU(OnStartOrLoad);
!!UN:P(MJ_OPTION)/?i^mj_enabled^;
!!VRi^mj_enabled^|i^cr_hasResound^<>(TRUE):S(FALSE); [needs Resound, see "31 forge and fury - dependencies.erm"]

; ============= ARTIFACT SETUP =====================================================================

!?FU(MJ_SetUpArtifact);
!!UN:A(MJ_ART)/1/(MJ_COST);
!!UN:A(MJ_ART)/2/(MJ_ART_POSITION);
!!UN:A(MJ_ART)/3/(MJ_ART_CLASS);
!!UN:A(MJ_ART)/1;                        [never appears on the map: it is only made from its parts]

!!SN:H^art^/(MJ_ART)/0/^Minerjack^;
!!SN:H^art^/(MJ_ART)/1/^{Minerjack}

Forged from the Inexhaustible Cart of Ore and the Inexhaustible Cart of Lumber, this wagon never runs empty.

When equipped (or carried in the backpack), it provides your kingdom with an additional +10 Wood and +10 Ore per day.^;

!!UN:A(MJ_COMBO_SLOT)/(MJ_ART)/(ART_INEXHAUSTIBLE_CART_OF_ORE)/(ART_INEXHAUSTIBLE_CART_OF_LUMBER);

!#FU(MJ_SetUpArtifact)&i^mj_enabled^:P;

!?FU(OnAfterLoadGame)&i^mj_enabled^;
!!FU(MJ_SetUpArtifact):P;

; ============= DAILY RESOURCES ====================================================================
; Once per day (first player of the day), from day 2 on - like the game's own resource artifacts.

!?FU(OnEveryDay)&i^mj_enabled^/i^timerOnce^=1/i^timerDay^>1;
!!re i/(HERO_FIRST)/(HERO_LAST_WOG);
  !!HEi:O?(owner:y);
  !!co&(owner)<=(NO_OWNER);

  !!HEi:A2/(MJ_ART)/?(count:y)/?(equipped:y);  [count = equipped + backpack]
  !!co&(count)<=0;

  !!VR(wood:y):S(count) *(MJ_WOOD_PER_DAY);
  !!VR(ore:y):S(count) *(MJ_ORE_PER_DAY);
  !!OW:R(owner)/(RES_WOOD)/d(wood);
  !!OW:R(owner)/(RES_ORE)/d(ore);
!!en;
